config BR2_PACKAGE_HARDENED_NANOKVM_KVMAPP
	bool "Hardened NanoKVM application payload"
	depends on BR2_RISCV_64
	help
	  Install the locally built Hardened NanoKVM Rust application, native
	  runtime libraries, web assets, hardware helper, init scripts, and
	  system-update public key into the SG2002 rootfs.

	  The package expects build/kvmapp-rust/kvmapp to exist in the parent
	  project. It does not build the application or prove vendor multimedia
	  ABI compatibility.
